MIT License

zetetic-team-subagents — 97 reasoning patterns plus 19 team-role agents for
Claude Code, with commit-time enforcement of source discipline. Each genius
agent is built around a primary academic source; each team agent specializes
in a professional role. The pre-commit hook gates magic numbers, unsourced
absolute claims, and ticket-less TODOs so the standard travels with the
code, not just the prompts. Part of the ai-architect ecosystem
(https://github.com/cdeust/Cortex,
 https://github.com/cdeust/automatised-pipeline,
 https://github.com/cdeust/prd-spec-generator).

